 "words": 229,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Hannah wept at Shiloh and her lips moved with no sound",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Old Eli thought she'd had the wine, but grief had brought her down",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She came back with a little boy and gave him with both hands",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I prayed for this child",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So now I give him to the LORD",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In those days the word of the LORD was rare",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The lamp of God had not yet gone out",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The boy lay in the temple in the quiet midnight air",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When a voice called out his name and he ran to Eli's side",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here I am; you called me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speak, LORD, for your servant is listening",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the stillness of the night",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speak, LORD, for your servant is listening",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Till the lamp gives way to light",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Years went by and Samuel came with oil to Bethlehem",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven sons passed by him, and the LORD chose none of them",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They sent out for the youngest one who kept the sheep that day",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rise and anoint him; this is the one",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Man looks at the outward appearance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the LORD looks at the heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
